00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:15.210
- [Kelly] Yeah. Yeah. (laughs)

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.030
- I feel like I'm, I'm starting
to like be in a position

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.060
to where I can actually give
back and kind of help people-

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:22.590
- Yeah.
- Up and it feels really nice.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:24.900
I mean, we're even doing
this emerging artist program

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.550
with Tractor Supply, but this specific

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.370
- Awesome.
- Story is so crazy.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:32.400
We were in New York City
and I was playing my,

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.620
I'm on my very first
headlining tour right now.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:35.805
- Yeah. Congratulations, by the way.

00:00:35.805 --> 00:00:36.638
(applause)
(cheering)

00:00:36.638 --> 00:00:37.471
- And it has been-
- That's so cool.

00:00:37.471 --> 00:00:40.667
- Awesome. It has been so
awesome, but I see this sign

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:43.380
out in the crowd and I've got
terrible vision, so I'm kinda

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:44.610
like squinting, trying to see it,

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.550
and it says "will you sign my forehead?"

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:50.340
And I'm like, "Absolutely,
you better get up here,

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:51.840
I'm gonna sign your forehead!"
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.050
But when she gets closer, I
realized that a week prior

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:58.440
this little girl had put
up a TikTok about people

00:00:58.440 --> 00:00:59.730
making fun of the way she dressed.

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:02.130
She dressed like me at school, and I-

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:03.900
- You look like you're straight up

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.550
outta Fleetwood Mac, I love your look.

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:07.620
- Yeah, and I think that
kind of scares some people

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.300
but this little girl it did not scare her.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.310
So when I realized that was her,

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:13.080
I brought her up on stage and I had her

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.350
sign my forehead, too. (laughing)

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:17.285
- [Kelly] I, I love that.

00:01:17.285 --> 00:01:19.020
(crowd applauding)
- Yeah. (laughing)

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.520
- That's so cool.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.080
- It made my night. It did.
That's what it's all about-

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.580
- And tell her all those
girls making fun of you

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:24.413
are gonna peak in high school-
- [Lainey] That's right,

00:01:24.413 --> 00:01:26.422
that's right.
- Like we were talking about.

00:01:26.422 --> 00:01:28.203
- Yup, that's right.
(laughter)

00:01:28.203 --> 00:01:29.036
- Zach-

00:01:29.036 --> 00:01:30.396
- All those quarterbacks
are all fat and bald now.

00:01:30.396 --> 00:01:31.513
(Kelly laughing)
- [Lainey] That's right.

00:01:31.513 --> 00:01:32.892
- You know what I mean?
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:33.725
(crowd laughing)
- All those Nerds?

00:01:33.725 --> 00:01:34.564
- Uh-huh.
- Check it out.

00:01:34.564 --> 00:01:35.490
