(burst of applause)

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.870
- Look at these buttons. (laughing)

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:38.340
So wait, Zachary, wait.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:40.380
Do you have a favorite moment
with a fan that you met

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.335
like on a street or at a
convention or anything?

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:43.230
- Uuuuhm-

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:44.063
- You probably have many.

00:01:44.063 --> 00:01:45.510
- I mean, I don't know.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:46.343
- Some interesting ones.

00:01:46.343 --> 00:01:48.180
- Yeah, I think the one,
honestly, the, the, the fan

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:50.430
the ones that I remember the
most are when I meet people

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.260
like a conventions and things like that,

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:54.270
who tell me that something that I've done,

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.310
whether it's Chuck or Tangled
or Shazam or whatever,

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.320
like resonated with them
on a very deep level

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.210
and helped them through
a time in their life

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:02.226
that otherwise would've
been way too dark, you know?

00:02:02.226 --> 00:02:03.627
- That's right. That's right.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:03.627 --> 00:02:05.370
- Like, you know, people
losing loved ones and then they

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.370
they find Chuck and it helped
buoy their soul like that

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:09.597
as an artist, as an entertainer-

00:02:09.597 --> 00:02:11.129
- That's what great Art is supposed to do.

00:02:11.129 --> 00:02:11.962
- Yeah that's absolutely what-
- [Lainey] Exactly.

00:02:11.962 --> 00:02:12.943
- You're hoping to do.
So, that's all the stuff-

00:02:12.943 --> 00:02:14.510
- [Lainey] I love that.
- that I remember most.

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:15.750
And people wanted me to
